  <item>
    <title>2.《隐语》做书故事：内向是写作者的天赋</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63f48dad51a4e4150af514f2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63f48dad51a4e4150af514f2</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 21 Feb 2023 09:23:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>做書小酒馆的第二期我们请到了人民文学最近出版的短篇小说集《隐语》的作者和编辑。</span></p><span></span><p><span>编辑在读这本小说集的那周，北京下了23年的第一场雪，阳光被雪地反射后照在书页上变成了冷冷的银光，就像这本小说中讲述的那些年轻人的故事，在沉默的冰面下隐隐发着光。</span></p><span></span><p><span>借着作者薛超伟来北京参加新书发布会的机会我们邀请他和编辑郭婷来书店，我们聊了聊他们寂寞的相遇、漫长的做书、彼此的困惑与坚持......那些隐没在书背后的人与事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎您来听！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>/主持人/</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>书婷、公园</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>/嘉宾/</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>薛超伟 青年作家</span></p><span></span><p><span>郭婷 编辑</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>/时间轴/</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> 作者和编辑的相遇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="365">06:05</a> 彼此的第一印象“慌张而坚定的人”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="560">09:20</a> 担心“社恐”的营销标签会狭窄这部丰富的作品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 作品中有自我的投射，也在努力把作者择出纸面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="830">13:50</a> 寂寞的写作者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a> 创作的“方法论”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1415">23:35</a> 漫长而坚决的做书过程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1878">31:18</a> 内向小孩也有无数的样子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2070">34:30</a> 坚定而摇摇晃晃走在写作的道路上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2720">45:20</a> 内向小孩慌慌张张长大</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2982">49:42</a> 写作者如何面对外界的声音</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3370">56:10</a> “他把你内心绵密的想法像扯线头一样扯出来，再轻轻放回去。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3599">59:59</a> 擅长在文字中埋进谜语、机锋与残酷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4152">01:09:12</a> 《隐语》值得一读！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgc95PmgD-aeMUpVtHrL5L4keQnQ.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqhkULfHEBf6-vg6RCWzuFbx41FU.m4a" length="110726389" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:16:17</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiKdtSSHTYP8tWoqrta2bAx1O-Lo.jpg"/>
    <itunes:episode>2</itunes:episode>
