  <item>
    <title>1.小品牌与独立编辑二三事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6379f73c7105b234344c0b8e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6379f73c7105b234344c0b8e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 20 Nov 2022 09:45:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>做書小酒馆终于有了第一期节目！算上前面黄了的三期，这其实是第四期了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>趁着明室两位主创在京，我们喊来了铸刻的陈凌云老师，就小品牌的创立、营销、门槛、条件等一些话题聊了聊。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持：刘松，做書主理人之一</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈希颖，明室创始人、主编</span></p><span></span><p><span>赵磊，明室副主编</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈凌云，铸刻文化创始人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> &nbsp;我们是怎么走上创业道路的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="289">04:49</a> &nbsp;二十年前的新编辑培训</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="961">16:01</a> &nbsp;“一分钟经理人”和编辑幸福感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1142">19:02</a> &nbsp;聊到了虚荣心——编辑事业的核心动力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1346">22:26</a> &nbsp;老生常谈的话题——对书的热情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1495">24:55</a> &nbsp;聊到了怎么算账的问题，聊了聊新公司怎么买版权</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2172">36:12</a> &nbsp;吐槽了一下短视频带货</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2415">40:15</a> &nbsp;大众还是小众</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2602">43:22</a> &nbsp;书系的视觉管理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2882">48:02</a> &nbsp;需要多少钱？看你做不做印刷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3070">51:10</a> &nbsp;在中国做代理人行得通吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3281">54:41</a> &nbsp;独立策划人的几个例子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4050">01:07:30</a> &nbsp;自己干需要哪些条件？版权积累</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4342">01:12:22</a> &nbsp;不想着做畅销书，就不容易亏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4409">01:13:29</a> &nbsp;做不做印刷，这是一个问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4541">01:15:41</a> &nbsp;关于合作方的推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4745">01:19:05</a> &nbsp;中国的读者数量有多少？参考百年孤独</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5053">01:24:13</a> &nbsp;小品牌的最大优势：快，不受约束</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5406">01:30:06</a> &nbsp;品牌重要吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5973">01:39:33</a> &nbsp;最后的话</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltvBj4YocyOeljzBX6Lo0cSmUekx.m4a" length="147809685" type="audio/mp4"/>
